; Random number generator using linear feedback shift register (LFSR)
; Shifts bits and XORs with mask when carry is set

LDAi AC   ; put 0xAC in acc A
LDBi E1   ; put 0xE1 in acc B
LSR       ; shift right (and into carry)
BCC FD    ; branch -3 if carry clear
EORAi B4  ; toggle mask
EORBi 00  ; XOR B with 0
PAUSE     ; pause to see result
BZC F6    ; branch up to the shift
HALT
